#3100
Zone31 Mara Willow Cup Ambient~
0 b 5
~
if !%self.fighting%
  switch %random.4%
    case 1
      emote checks a copper kettle, then lowers the flame beneath it.
    break
    case 2
      emote wipes the polished counter with a clean linen cloth.
    break
    case 3
      emote measures dried herbs into a small clay jar and ties it shut.
    break
    case 4
      say The willow keeps this place cooler than any stone roof ever could.
    break
  done
end
~
#3101
Zone31 Brother Oren Last Lantern Ambient~
0 b 5
~
if !%self.fighting%
  switch %random.4%
    case 1
      emote brushes loose soil from the head of his spade.
    break
    case 2
      emote pauses to straighten a small lantern token beside a weathered grave.
    break
    case 3
      emote checks the chapel door and gives its old hinges an approving nod.
    break
    case 4
      say Every name here belonged to someone who thought tomorrow was promised.
    break
  done
end
~
#3102
Zone31 Captain Dain Southwatch Ambient~
0 b 5
~
if !%self.fighting%
  switch %random.4%
    case 1
      emote runs a finger down the patrol roster and makes a short notation.
    break
    case 2
      emote checks the ring of secured keys at his belt.
    break
    case 3
      say Keep the commons quiet, keep the southern gate watched, and keep your eyes open.
    break
    case 4
      emote studies the duty board before glancing toward the barracks door.
    break
  done
end
~
#3103
Zone31 Southwatch Guardsman Ambient~
0 b 2
~
if !%self.fighting%
  switch %random.5%
    case 1
      emote checks the strap of a well-used patrol shield.
    break
    case 2
      emote exchanges a quiet word with another watchman about the next patrol.
    break
    case 3
      emote scans the doorway and nearby windows with practiced attention.
    break
    case 4
      emote adjusts the blue-and-silver tabard over serviceable mail.
    break
    case 5
      say Southwatch road is clear. Keep it that way.
    break
  done
end
~
#3104
Zone31 Clerk Meriel Civic Hall Ambient~
0 b 5
~
if !%self.fighting%
  switch %random.4%
    case 1
      emote sands a freshly written petition and sets it aside to dry.
    break
    case 2
      emote ties a completed folio with colored cord and adds it to a neat stack.
    break
    case 3
      emote compares two wax seals before entering a note in a heavy ledger.
    break
    case 4
      say Petitions for the Lord Mayor go in the blue-bound ledger, not the red one.
    break
  done
end
~
#3105
Zone31 Lord Mayor Edric Vale Ambient~
0 b 4
~
if !%self.fighting%
  switch %random.4%
    case 1
      emote shifts a marker across the map of Midgaard and studies the southern wards.
    break
    case 2
      emote reads a petition twice before writing a brief decision in its margin.
    break
    case 3
      emote looks toward the ward banners, lost in thought for a moment.
    break
    case 4
      say A city survives by tending small problems before they become large ones.
    break
  done
end
~
#3106
Zone31 Midgaard Town Crier Ambient~
0 b 4
~
if !%self.fighting%
  switch %random.5%
    case 1
      emote rings a brass handbell three times.
      say Hear this! Keep the southern concourse clear for patrols and merchant carts!
    break
    case 2
      emote unrolls a wax-sealed notice and raises his voice.
      say By civic order, damaged lanterns and broken paving are to be reported at Civic Hall!
    break
    case 3
      emote rings his bell and waits for nearby conversation to fade.
      say Citizens are reminded that the Skychain anchor is not a hitching post!
    break
    case 4
      emote checks the next notice in his leather folio.
      say The Commons remain open to all peaceful citizens from dawn until the late bells!
    break
    case 5
      emote clears his throat and strikes the bell once.
      say Travelers bound beyond the South Gate should carry water and mind the road markers!
    break
  done
end
~
#3107
Zone31 Silver Necked Swan Ambient~
0 b 3
~
if !%self.fighting%
  switch %random.4%
    case 1
      emote glides in a slow circle, barely disturbing the pond.
    break
    case 2
      emote dips its long neck beneath the water and emerges trailing silver droplets.
    break
    case 3
      emote fixes the nearest passerby with an imperious black-eyed stare.
    break
    case 4
      emote ruffles its white wings before settling them neatly against its sides.
    break
  done
end
~
#3108
Zone31 Downy Duckling Ambient~
0 b 3
~
if !%self.fighting%
  switch %random.4%
    case 1
      emote paddles after a drifting leaf with frantic determination.
    break
    case 2
      emote peeps softly and hurries toward the shelter of the reeds.
    break
    case 3
      emote shakes a few droplets from its down and immediately gets wet again.
    break
    case 4
      emote turns in a tiny circle as though it has forgotten where it was going.
    break
  done
end
~
#3109
Zone31 Russet Sparrow Ambient~
0 b 3
~
if !%self.fighting%
  switch %random.4%
    case 1
      emote hops twice across the paving and pecks at an invisible crumb.
    break
    case 2
      emote flits to a low branch and chirps sharply at the path below.
    break
    case 3
      emote tilts its head, watching nearby footsteps with bright black eyes.
    break
    case 4
      emote disappears into the leaves for a moment before dropping back to the path.
    break
  done
end
~
#3110
Zone31 Mottled Park Duck Ambient~
0 b 3
~
if !%self.fighting%
  switch %random.4%
    case 1
      emote waddles closer with the shameless confidence of a practiced beggar.
    break
    case 2
      emote probes the grass with its bill in search of something edible.
    break
    case 3
      emote gives an indignant quack at absolutely nothing.
    break
    case 4
      emote settles its feathers and resumes watching for unattended food.
    break
  done
end
~
#3111
Zone31 Skychain Crossing Ambient~
2 b 2
~
switch %random.5%
  case 1
    %echo% A faint metallic groan travels down the colossal Skychain from somewhere above the clouds.
  break
  case 2
    %echo% Pale runes around the Skychain anchor flicker once, then fade back into the stone.
  break
  case 3
    %echo% A high wind stirs overhead, yet the immense black links of the Skychain remain perfectly still.
  break
  case 4
    %echo% For a heartbeat, the ancient anchor gives off the scent of rain on cold iron.
  break
  case 5
    %echo% Somewhere far above, one enormous chain link knocks softly against another with a distant bell-like tone.
  break
done
~
$~
